"Needle & Wheedle is a tailor a couple of streets back from Apex's northern coast."
"It is where Rabbits who often visit the Triplanets come for clothes."
"It has no sign or website, only its name raised on a custom doorknob, and works by appointment."
"Its curtained seating area has a leather chair, shelves of top hats and a fashion-show drone."
"The dressing room's mirror shows front, sides and back; clothes are made in a back room."
"Recommended customers get a free consultation; it keeps client files and delivers to dorms."
"Its street has a steakhouse, an attorney's office and a shop selling pocket knives."
"That stretch of Apex's northern coast escaped the Matadero floods."
